  "plain": "In 1996, in the Brazilian town of Varginha, where people say a strange creature was seen and taken away, one witness says the craft was hovering over the hospital. The documentary filmmaker James Fox tells Michels he recently met this person, another witness on top of those he already had. If true, the craft would have been right above the place where, other accounts say, the being was brought."
